                },
                "category": "interaction",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>A fear eater's hookah pipe allows them to make smoke ring Strikes when wielded in 1 hand. Like a weapon, it can be Disarmed, but it's attached to the hookah bowl strapped to the fear eater's back and always remains in their space, even if they move.</p>"
